#: backgnd.cpp:180 bgdialogs.cpp:679
msgid "&Mode:"
msgstr "&Phu+o+ng thu+'c:"

#: backgnd.cpp:193
msgid ""
"You can select the manner in which the background is painted. The choices "
"are: <ul><li><em>Flat:</em> Use a solid color (\"Color 1\").</li> "
"<li><em>Pattern:</em> Use a two-color pattern. Click \"Setup\" to choose the "
"pattern.</li> <li><em>Gradients:</em> Blend two colors using a predefined "
"gradient (horizontal, vertical, etc.).</li> <li><em>Program:</em> Use an "
"application which paints the background, for example, with a day/night map "
"of the world that is refreshed periodically. Click \"Setup\" to select and "
"configure the program.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Ba.n co' the^? cho.n ca'ch thu+'c ma` hi`nh ne^`n se~ ddu+o+.c to^ . Ca'c su+. lu+.a cho.n co' the^? la`:"
"<ul><li><em>Pha(?ng:</em>Du`ng ma`u dda(.c (\"Ma`u 1\").</li>"
"<li><em>Pattern:</em> Du`ng mo^.t pattern ma`u ke'p. Nha^'n \"Ca`i dda(.t\" dde^? cho.n"
"pattern . </li><li><em>Gradient:</em> Tro^.n hai ma`u du`ng mo^.t gradient dda~ ddu+o+.c ddi.nh nghi~a tru+o+'c"
"(tha(?ng, ngang, vv...).</li><li><em>Chu+o+ng tri`nh:</em>Du`ng mo^.t chu+o+ng "
"tri`nh dde^? ve~ hi`nh ne^`n, vi' du., ve~ ba?n ddo^` ddu+o+.c refresh tua^`n hoa`n nga`y/dde^m cu?a the^' gio+'i ."
"Nha^'n \"Ca`i dda(.t\" dde^? cho.n va` ca^'u hi`nh chu+o+ng tri`nh . </li><ul>"

